  "claim_boundary": "Audit-only investigation of DynamicShapeField strong-context suspicious cases. It compares full_current against static_shape rows, treats score/margin changes as readout consumption evidence, and classifies classifier-overreach vs residual watchpoints. It is not a kernel change, not a tuning license, and not CO proof.",
